OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's left-wing President Lula is
OL,8,Felected for a fourth term, beating
OL,9,FFlavio Bolsonaro in a knife-edge vote
OL,11,FLula, 80, told supporters in Sao Paulo
OL,12,Fthat Brazil "will not accept being
OL,13,Fanyone's back yard" - who is Lula?
OL,15,FRight-wing senator Bolsonaro says the
OL,16,Fresult is "inexplicable" and calls for
OL,17,Fit to be annulled. The son of former
OL,18,Fpresident Jair Bolsonaro, who is under
OL,19,Fhouse arrest, won the first round
OL,20,Fearlier this month
